            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova asikari ongulumuronirini asi ndriza fele yi dri ’borisi, ’yozu kini, Asi ndriza Misiri dri, yi suru mani, azini Asuria dri, yi dri mani ma azi, azini Israeli dri indi, yi yila mani.",
